}

body:json {
  {
    "tmdbId": 157336,
    "mediaType": "movie"
  }
}

docs {
  # Toggle My List Item

  Adds a title to the authenticated user's list if not present, or removes it if already present (`POST /api/my-list/toggle`).
  Requires authentication (`authMiddleware`).

  ## Request Body
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `tmdbId` | `number` | Yes | Numeric TMDB identifier. |
  | `mediaType` | `"movie" \| "tv"` | Yes | Content media type. |

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**: `{ "added": true }` when added, or `{ "added": false }` when removed.
  - **400 Bad Request**: `{ "error": "tmdbId and mediaType are required" }`.
  - **401 Unauthorized**: `{ "error": "Unauthorized" }`.
  - **500 Internal Server Error**: `{ "error": "<message>" }`.
}

